<!--
  Themeable icon monochrome layer (themed app icons): when the launcher
  applies a theme to this icon, the system replaces the color layers with
  this single-color glyph and tints it with the user's chosen color.
  Simplified monochrome of the launcher mark — the three growth bars and
  the up trend line of ic_launcher_foreground in one flat color, so the
  shape reads at launchers' small sizes. The system applies its own tint;
  the white fill here is the neutral convention.
-->
